* Program-current bench: the committed program path from
* design/efuse_otp_array.spice (efuse_coldrv with its level shifter -> bitline ->
* efuse_bitcell select, and efuse_rowdrv with its level shifter -> word line) driving
* ONE selected cell. Circuit body for `klt sim` (no .control/.end). run.sh substitutes
* /home/ubuntu/.ciel/ciel/gf180mcu/versions/f6eeac7dad085ffcc829ccfd721f7b4ce39edcf7/gf180mcuD/libs.tech/ngspice/design.ngspice and appends the extracted subcircuits and the cell variant.
.include /home/ubuntu/.ciel/ciel/gf180mcu/versions/f6eeac7dad085ffcc829ccfd721f7b4ce39edcf7/gf180mcuD/libs.tech/ngspice/design.ngspice

* Logic supply and program supply; klt sim alters Vdd33 and Vvprog per corner
* (2.97 / 3.30 / 3.63 V and 4.5 / 5.0 / 5.5 V, decision 0005).
Vdd33 vdd33 0 DC 3.3
Vprog vprog 0 DC 5.0

* Selected row and column, program strobe asserted, sense_en deasserted (3.3 V domain,
* tracks vdd33 per corner).
Rrow row_sel vdd33 1
Rcol col_sel vdd33 1
Rstb prog_strobe vdd33 1
Rsen sense_en 0 1

Xrd row_sel wl vdd33 vprog 0 efuse_rowdrv
Xcd col_sel prog_strobe sense_en bl sbl vdd33 vprog 0 efuse_coldrv
* ASSUMPTION (no documented source): lumped routing resistance between the column
* driver and the cell, matching sim/program-select (set only in run.sh).
Rroute bl blc 20
Xcell blc wl 0 efuse_bitcell
* Sense side of the column mux is left open: the read pass device is off (rd high).
Rsbl sbl 0 1G

* Unused one-point sweep axis: plain .meas cards need a dc sweep and the operating
* point is the same at every point.
Vdmy dmy 0 0
Rdmy dmy 0 1k

.subckt efuse_bitcell bl wl vss
*.iopin bl
*.ipin wl
*.iopin vss
RXf bl n 260
XXsel n wl vss vss nfet_06v0 L=0.7u W=60u nf=1 ad='int((nf+1)/2) * W/nf * 0.18u' as='int((nf+2)/2) * W/nf * 0.18u' pd='2*int((nf+1)/2) * (W/nf + 0.18u)'
+ ps='2*int((nf+2)/2) * (W/nf + 0.18u)' nrd='0.18u / W' nrs='0.18u / W' sa=0 sb=0 sd=0 m=1
.ends

.subckt efuse_rowdrv row_sel wl vdd33 vprog vss
*.ipin row_sel
*.opin wl
*.iopin vdd33
*.iopin vprog
*.iopin vss
Xls row_sel wl vdd33 vprog vss efuse_ls
.ends

